\textbar\textbar{}
\par
Challenges:
\par
- Framework is intentionally non-prescriptive, requiring significant organizational interpretation.
\par
- Lacks concrete quantitative metrics for many trustworthiness characteristics.
\par
- Implementation may be resource-intensive for small or under-resourced organizations.
\par
- Tradeoffs among trustworthiness characteristics are identified but not algorithmically resolved.
